			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Format workspace directory traversal condition\n\nReflow the multi-line condition in `ParseWorkspaceFolders` within `Source/Binary/Initialize/CliParse.rs` to a single line. This aligns the Rust syntax with the project's formatting standards and maintains consistency with recent stylistic adjustments across the backend.\n\nThe change affects only whitespace and line breaks; no logic or behavior is altered. The `WalkUpToProjectRoot` traversal logic remains intact.",
